 :adr/context
 "Secondary education (ISIC 852) serves middle and high school students aged ~11–19.
  Unlike primary education (ISIC 851), secondary students have greater cognitive autonomy
  yet remain minors requiring parental/guardian oversight. Implemented as Wave 4 actor
  following patterns in ADR-2607072915 (ISIC 851) and ADR-2607152700 (ISIC 873)."
